title: "Guwahati airport (LGBI / VEGT) visibility observations and terminal-transfer reference, 2023-2026"
abstract: >-
  Three and a half years of routine half-hourly airport visibility observations for
  Lokpriya Gopinath Bordoloi International Airport, Guwahati (ICAO VEGT / IEM GAU),
  with the analysis code, the by-month and by-hour tables, the short visibility note
  and a terminal-transfer reference table.
